kiro-atelier-wallpapers

The paintings were made with Kiro Atelier by Erik Dubois (kiroproject.be) and may be shared freely, unchanged,
for example in a package repository, a mirror or a Linux installation image.

The original picture they were painted from is a wallpaper found on wallhaven.cc; its artist is unknown and keeps
any rights to it. If it is your work, open an issue at https://github.com/kirodubes/kiro-atelier-wallpapers and we
will credit you or remove it.

Provided "as is", without any warranty.
